l Intelligence for Kids aged 7-14 (AI Adventures for Young Minds) </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1319,\"width\":\"250px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://amzn.to/44pWXab\"><img src=\"http://remediation.aiamigos.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot-2024-02-29-221148.png\" alt=\"\nIntroduction to Artificial Intelligence for Kids aged 7-14 (AI Adventures for Young Minds) \" class=\"wp-image-1319\" style=\"width:250px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"brainy-bots-top-20-ai-algorithm-funventure-ai-adventures-for-young-minds\"><strong>Brainy Bots: Top 20+ AI Algorithm Funventure (AI Adventures for Young Minds)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1320,\"width\":\"244px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://amzn.to/4dfA654\"><img src=\"http://remediation.aiamigos.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot-2024-01-20-164206.png\" alt=\"Brainy Bots: Top 20+ AI Algorithm Funventure (AI Adventures for Young Minds)\" class=\"wp-image-1320\" style=\"width:244px;height:auto\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"fantastic-futures-the-adventures-of-ai-and-our-world-ai-adventures-for-young-minds\">Fantastic Futures: The Adventures of AI and Our World (AI Adventures for Young Minds) </h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1323,\"width\":\"237px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n